{"id":"n83346-2-4","stage":4,"title":"포기 · 棵","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83346-2-4-1","ko":"이번에 김장을 얼마나 할 거야?","zh":"这次要腌多少泡菜啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"김장을","meaning":"腌菜，腌辛奇","explanation":"김장：腌菜，腌辛奇；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"김장","audio":"/audio/68de8ca9389d033ce19b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"45128","senseId":"1","lemma":"김장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마나：多少","readings":[{"term":"얼마나","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67316","senseId":"2","lemma":"얼마나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"做，作，置办","explanation":"하다：做，作，置办；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"68de8ca9389d033c","term":"김장","zh":"腌菜，腌辛奇","audio":"/audio/68de8ca9389d033ce19b.mp3","entryId":"45128","definition":"深秋时节，为满足整个冬天所需，一次性大量腌制辛奇；或指那样腌制的辛奇。","pronunciation":["김장"]},{"id":"7ab030dec3a95b0f","term":"얼마나","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/7ab030dec3a95b0f3edd.mp3","entryId":"67316","definition":"达到某个程度地。","pronunciation":["얼마나"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，作，置办","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"制作或准备什么东西。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/6a1baa8e0c3c831ad9f8.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83346-2-4-2","ko":"서른 포기 정도 하려고 해.","zh":"打算腌大概三十颗泡菜。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"서른","meaning":"三十","explanation":"서른：三十","readings":[{"term":"서른","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31570","senseId":"1","lemma":"서른","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"포기","meaning":"棵，株","explanation":"포기：棵，株","readings":[{"term":"포기","audio":"/audio/c1f1102e79f0f0f9ee8e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83346","senseId":"2","lemma":"포기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정도","meaning":"左右","explanation":"정도：左右","readings":[{"term":"정도","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70876","senseId":"3","lemma":"정도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하려고","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；려고：表示意图或打算：“想要、打算”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"打算做（-려고 하다）","explanation":"하다：打算做（-려고 하다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"2","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e2739e161b065c33","term":"서른","zh":"三十","audio":"/audio/e2739e161b065c33c6b4.mp3","entryId":"31570","definition":"十的三倍的数目。","pronunciation":["서른"]},{"id":"c1f1102e79f0f0f9","term":"포기","zh":"棵，株","audio":"/audio/c1f1102e79f0f0f9ee8e.mp3","entryId":"83346","definition":"计算以根为单位的草或树的单位。","pronunciation":["포기"]},{"id":"1a771e4b7f99176b","term":"정도","zh":"左右","audio":"/audio/1a771e4b7f99176bc0a6.mp3","entryId":"70876","definition":"那样的分量或水准。","pronunciation":["정도"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干；打算做（-려고 하다）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c0ddfb0a5f1e58ffc41b.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.698,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=83346","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"고급","day":129,"sequenceScore":2.4233,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["打算腌大概三十颗泡菜。","这次要腌多少泡菜啊？","时间已经太晚了，我们打车走吧。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这次要腌多少泡菜啊？","时间已经太晚了，我们打车走吧。","打算腌大概三十颗泡菜。"],"answer":2}]}
